diff --git a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
index 6bddff1..9f2923a 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -96,3 +96,40 @@ __Request:__
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `POST /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Subscribes a device to push notifications, so that whatever lands in the user's tray is also pushed to that device.
+The values come from the [PushSubscription](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/PushSubscription) the browser got from its push service, and are signed with the instance's VAPID key pair.
+
+Only the current user can subscribe their own devices. Subscribing a device that's already known refreshes its keys.
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `endpoint` | string | Yes | The push service URL that delivers notifications to this device |
+| `p256dh_key` | string | Yes | The device's public key |
+| `auth_key` | string | Yes | The device's authentication secret |
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "push_subscription": {
+    "endpoint": "https://push.example.com/subscriptions/abc123",
+    "p256dh_key": "BNc...",
+    "auth_key": "k4E..."
+  }
+}
+```
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` on success.
+
+## `DELETE /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions/:id`
+
+Unsubscribes a device from push notifications.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
